# --- Start Positron ---
# Webpack writes the bundle to dist/. In a dev checkout, out/ holds tsc and test
# output, and the caches below hold tool output. A local release build shipped
# them. See https://github.com/posit-dev/positron/issues/16695.
out/**
**/*.stats.json
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache/**
# The Python kernel tests, and the tests that the bundled packages ship (IPython,
# traitlets, pyzmq, debugpy). No runtime code imports them. IPython/testing is a
# different directory, and IPython imports it at runtime, so it needs to stay.
# See https://github.com/posit-dev/positron/issues/16025.
python_files/posit/positron/tests/**
python_files/lib/ipykernel/**/tests/**
# --- End Positron ---
